        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Hamani mwana a-Hamedata mu-Agagi, sinkondonyina waba-Juda, wakayungide kubanyonyoona akuwaala nkakata iitegwa “puri”, kuti abazunde, abanyonyoone; ",
