              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo balaaulika mazuba ayo kuti ngama-Puri akaambo kankakata iitegwa “puri”. Elyo akaambo kayaayo oonse akalembwa mulugwalo olu, alimwi akaambo kaceeco cakacitika kulimbabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
