              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuti aya akayeeyegwe akubambwa azyalani lyoonse, amunzi woonse, acisi coonse, amunzi mupati woonse, kuti mazuba aya aama-Puri atakazimwi akati kaba-Juda, alimwi kuti luyeeyo lwangawo lutakamani kubana babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
